Changes made to the original work (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):

  * The Python package EvoScientist was renamed to metasci_scribe, and the
    module EvoScientist/EvoScientist.py became metasci_scribe/agent.py.
  * The configuration class EvoScientistConfig was renamed to ScribeConfig.
  * The environment variable prefixes EVOSCIENTIST_ and EVOSCI_ were replaced
    by METASCI_SCRIBE_, and the data directory ~/.evoscientist became
    ~/.metasci-scribe.
  * The command line entry points evoscientist, EvoScientist, evosci and
    EvoSci were replaced by the single command metasci-scribe.
  * The one-time migration of old session databases (migrate_legacy_sessions_db)
    was removed, together with its tests.
  * The Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, .dockerignore, README.zh-CN.md and the
    .github/assets images (EvoScientist logos, badges and benchmark figures)
    were removed, and README.md was replaced.
  * Links that point at the original project were left unchanged on purpose.
  * Further changes are recorded in the git history of this repository. The
    tool tools/rename_map.py performs the mechanical part of the rename.

